          "name": "PR01 - List promotions",
          "request": {
            "name": "PR01 - List promotions",
            "description": {
              "content": "<div class=\"api-description-extension\">\n<div class=\"extension-title\">Call Frequency</div>\n\n<div class=\"recommended-call-frequency\">Recommended usage: At each display of a promotions list page or on-promo offer detail page.</div>\n<div class=\"max-call-frequency\">Maximum usage: At each display of a promotions list page or on-promo offer detail page.</div>\n<div class=\"extension-title\">Read More</div>\n\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://help.mirakl.com/bundle/customers/page/topics/Mirakl/integrating_mirakl/integrate_promo/promo_website.html\">More context (Advertising promotions on the front end)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://help.mirakl.com/bundle/customers/page/topics/Mirakl/integrating_mirakl/integrate_promo/list_offers_eligible_for_promo.html\">More context (Product page: listing offers eligible for promotions)</a></li></ul><div class=\"extension-title\">Pagination</div>\n\n<p>This resource supports offset pagination (<a href=\"#section/Offset-pagination-and-sort\">see documentation</a>)</p>\n\n<div class=\"extension-title\">Sort fields</div>\n\n<code>sort</code> field can have the following values:<ul><li><b>startDate</b> (Default) - Sort by promotion activity start date (Newest first) (desc by default)</li><li><b>endDate</b> - Sort by promotion activity end date (Newest first) (desc by default)</li><li><b>dateCreated</b> - Sort by promotion creation date (Newest first) (desc by default)</li></ul>\n\n</div>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "promotions"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "ids",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "A comma separated list of identifiers for shop joined to an identifier for a promotion (structure: \"ids=&lt;shopId&gt;|&lt;promotionShopInternalId&gt;,&lt;shopId&gt;|&lt;promotionShopInternalId&gt;, ...\" Example: /api/promotion?ids=123|promo-dec-2016)"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "types",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "A comma separated list of types for a promotion [AMOUNT_OFF|FREE_ITEMS|PERCENTAGE_OFF|REDUCED_UNIT_PRICE]"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "states",
                  "value": "ACTIVE",
                  "description": "A comma separated list of states for a promotion [PENDING|ACTIVE|EXPIRED|PENDING_APPROVAL|REJECTED|ALL]"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "shop_ids",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "A comma separated list of shop ids"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "ending_after",
                  "value": "<dateTime>",
                  "description": "Returns promotions which ended or will end after this date"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "starting_before",
                  "value": "<dateTime>",
                  "description": "Returns promotions which started or will start before this date"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "date_created_from",
                  "value": "<dateTime>",
                  "description": "Filter promotion creation date lower limit"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "date_created_to",
                  "value": "<dateTime>",
                  "description": "Filter promotion creation date upper limit"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "last_request_date",
                  "value": "<dateTime>",
                  "description": "Last request date and time. We recommend using the differential mode along with the <code>states</code> parameter."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "locale",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "The locale to filter the medias and the public descriptions with. If not specified, medias and public descriptions of all locales are returned.If specified, only the media and the public description matching the locale will be returned, or, if not exist, the one matching the platform default locale."
